# Analysis

The `isMobileExpanded` prop is being passed through multiple sidebar components but **not actually controlling visibility** on mobile. The actual mobile sidebar behavior is handled by the parent layout. Removing this unused prop will simplify the component tree and reduce unnecessary re-renders.

| Component | Change |
|-----------|--------|
| **DesktopSidebar.vue** | Remove `isMobileExpanded` prop and state management |
| **AppsSection.vue** | Remove `isMobileExpanded` prop, simplify logic |
| **WorkspacesSection.vue** | Remove `isMobileExpanded` prop |
| **MoreSection.vue** | Remove `isMobileExpanded` prop |

---

