# Root Cause

Looking at `App.vue`, the mobile sidebar is controlled by `is-mobile-expanded` prop, but `DesktopSidebar.vue` uses `isCollapsed` internal state driven only by `isMobile` prop on mount. The **`is-mobile-expanded` prop is never declared** in `DesktopSidebar`, so the sidebar never knows when to open.

